<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <title>Welcome Call Center</title>
</head>
<body class="public">
  <nav class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">☀️</span>Welcome Call Center</a>
      <div class="topbar-links"><span class="pill pill-soft">🔒 Secure &amp; recorded</span></div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <h1>Complete your welcome call<br>in just a few minutes</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      As part of getting you set up, we do a quick, friendly welcome call to verify your
      information and make sure you fully understand your agreement. It takes about
      3&ndash;5 minutes, and you can do it right here — no appointment needed.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-points">
      <div class="point"><span class="point-icon">🕐</span><div><strong>Quick &amp; easy</strong><br>Simple yes / "I understand" answers</div></div>
      <div class="point"><span class="point-icon">🎙️</span><div><strong>Recorded for your protection</strong><br>Kept securely on file for compliance</div></div>
      <div class="point"><span class="point-icon">🤝</span><div><strong>Friendly &amp; pressure-free</strong><br>Questions? We'll flag them for a real person to follow up</div></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="narrow">
    <div class="card center-text">
      <div class="big-emoji">✉️</div>
      <h2>Your personal welcome call link</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        To make sure your call has your exact agreement details, welcome calls use a
        <strong>personal link prepared just for you</strong> — check your text messages or email
        for a link from our team that looks like <code>welcomeai.online/call/…</code>
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        Can't find your link, or haven't received one yet? Just reach out to your representative
        and we'll send it over — it takes seconds.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="fineprint">
      Welcome calls are recorded on an acknowledged, recorded line for quality and compliance purposes.
      You'll be asked to confirm this at the start of the call.
    </p>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Welcome Call Center · <a href="/admin" class="muted">Admin</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
